---
// AboutImpact.astro - Our Impact Section matching Figma mockup exactly
---

<section class="w-full bg-[#ECEAF5] text-slate-900 font-montserrat relative z-20 overflow-visible">
  <div class="max-w-[1350px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 overflow-visible">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-end overflow-visible">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Copy & Exact Figma Impact Text -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6 pt-16 sm:pt-20 lg:pt-24 pb-14 sm:pb-20 lg:pb-24">
        
        <!-- Main Headline in Purple -->
        <h2 class="font-nunito font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[44px] leading-tight text-[#2B1B47] tracking-tight line-clamp-2">
          Our Impact
        </h2>

        <!-- Exact 3 Paragraphs from Figma -->
        <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-[13.5px] text-slate-600 font-normal leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
          <p>
            We've helped authors publish over 280 titles across fiction, nonfiction, memoirs, business, and illustrated formats — 95 had their first batch sold pre-launch!
          </p>
          <p>
            Our books have hit top rankings on Amazon Kindle, secured features on Apple Books, and earned 4.8+ star average reviews.
          </p>
          <p>
            We've delivered projects in 12+ countries, across 18 genres and sub-genres, with clients from solopreneurs to global media teams.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Woman Holding Open Book protruding out of the top -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex justify-center lg:justify-end items-end self-end relative overflow-visible">
        <img 
          src="/image 20.png" 
          alt="Our Impact" 
          class="w-full max-w-[420px] sm:max-w-[480px] lg:max-w-[540px] xl:max-w-[580px] h-auto object-contain block select-none -mb-1 align-bottom lg:-mt-20 xl:-mt-28 relative z-30 pointer-events-none"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
